            <p><strong>Impact:</strong> Grassroots land records, Bhoomi e-governance operations, and taluk administration are managed by VAOs and RIs, benefiting from substantial basic salary expansion.</p>
            <span class="cadre-footer">VAO / SDA: ₹33,450 | 8th CPC (2.28x): <strong>₹76,266</strong></span>
          </div>

          <div class="cadre-box kas">
            <h4>Karnataka Administrative Service (KAS)</h4>
            <div class="cadre-badge">State Civil Services (KPSC Entry)</div>
            <p><strong>Covered Ranks:</strong> Assistant Commissioner / Sub-Divisional Magistrate (Scale 16: ₹67,550), Senior KAS Officers, and Additional Deputy Commissioners.</p>
            <p><strong>Impact:</strong> Forms the executive leadership of district administration, municipal corporations, and state secretariat wings, receiving parity with central Group 'A' entry scales.</p>
            <span class="cadre-footer">KAS Entry (7th PC): ₹67,550 | 8th CPC (2.28x): <strong>₹1,54,014</strong></span>
          </div>
