            <p><strong>Covered Cities:</strong> Mysuru, Hubballi-Dharwad, Mangaluru, Belagavi, Kalaburagi, and Ballari.</p>
            <span class="card-footer-note">Covers prominent industrial, educational, and regional municipal centers.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="city-box tier-groupC">
            <h4>Group C (District Headquarter Towns)</h4>
            <div class="badge-tag">Other District Administrative Centers</div>
            <p><strong>Projected HRA Rate:</strong> 14% of Basic Pay.</p>
            <p><strong>Covered Towns:</strong> Davanagere, Shivamogga, Tumakuru, Udupi, Hassan, Bidar, Raichur, and Kolar.</p>
            <span class="card-footer-note">Standard urban tier across district headquarters and major city municipal councils.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="city-box tier-groupD">
            <h4>Group D (Taluk Headposts &amp; Rural Stations)</h4>
